{
    "title": "Vector",
    "description": "In the gloomy world of the distant future, the freedom and will of man is suppressed by the all-powerful Big Brother \u2013 a totalitarian regime that watches your every move. But you're not going to be a submissive slave of the system, are you? Time to run!\r\n \r\nVector is a parkour-themed runner from the creators of the legendary Shadow Fight series, and it's back in a remastered version! Become a real urban ninja, hide from your pursuers, and break free... now with updated style!\r\n \r\nCOOL TRICKS\r\nSlides and somersaults: discover and perform dozens of moves from real tracers!\r\n \r\nUSEFUL GADGETS\r\nBoosters will help you achieve any goals. Use them to elude pursuit and get the coveted 3 stars!\r\n \r\nA CHALLENGE FOR EVERYONE\r\nVector is easy to master even for a novice player, but veterans of the genre will also find complex challenges for themselves. Surpass yourself!\r\n \r\nMEGAPOLIS OF THE FUTURE\r\nThe maze-like city will try to keep you in. Explore a new location, as well as dozens of detailed levels, including some never seen before, and break free!\r\n \r\nNEW MODES\r\nThere is always something to do in Vector. Every day a new special level awaits you: complete it or test your strength in increased difficulty mode!\r\n \r\nVISUAL UPGRADE\r\nThanks to the improved interface and updated graphics, immersing yourself in the atmosphere of an adrenaline chase is even easier. Take the leap to freedom!\r\n \r\nBECOME PART OF THE COMMUNITY\r\nShare your achievements with other players and follow the development of the game!\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/VectorTheGame\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/vectorthegame",
    "descriptionHTML": "In the gloomy world of the distant future, the freedom and will of man is suppressed by the all-powerful Big Brother \u2013 a totalitarian regime that watches your every move. But you&#39;re not going to be a submissive slave of the system, are you? Time to run!<br> <br>Vector is a parkour-themed runner from the creators of the legendary Shadow Fight series, and it&#39;s back in a remastered version! Become a real urban ninja, hide from your pursuers, and break free... now with updated style!<br> <br>COOL TRICKS<br>Slides and somersaults: discover and perform dozens of moves from real tracers!<br> <br>USEFUL GADGETS<br>Boosters will help you achieve any goals. Use them to elude pursuit and get the coveted 3 stars!<br> <br>A CHALLENGE FOR EVERYONE<br>Vector is easy to master even for a novice player, but veterans of the genre will also find complex challenges for themselves. Surpass yourself!<br> <br>MEGAPOLIS OF THE FUTURE<br>The maze-like city will try to keep you in. Explore a new location, as well as dozens of detailed levels, including some never seen before, and break free!<br> <br>NEW MODES<br>There is always something to do in Vector. Every day a new special level awaits you: complete it or test your strength in increased difficulty mode!<br> <br>VISUAL UPGRADE<br>Thanks to the improved interface and updated graphics, immersing yourself in the atmosphere of an adrenaline chase is even easier. Take the leap to freedom!<br> <br>BECOME PART OF THE COMMUNITY<br>Share your achievements with other players and follow the development of the game!<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/VectorTheGame<br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/vectorthegame",
